BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 295.59 Tm (Choose Django REST Framework \(mature, batteries included\) or Django Ninja \(fast, type hints,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 281.09 Tm (Pydantic\). Both are solid; Ninja is lighter and more modern, DRF has the bigger ecosystem.) Tj ET
