0.040 0.350 0.550 rg 61.00 111.09 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 108.59 Tm (Choose your auth model deliberately. Session auth with httpOnly cookies is simplest and safest for a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 94.09 Tm (same-site web app. JWT \(via simplejwt\) suits mobile clients and cross-domain APIs but adds token) Tj ET
