BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 738.39 Tm (django-cors-headers; never use a wildcard origin with credentials.) Tj ET
0.040 0.350 0.550 rg 61.00 726.39 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 723.89 Tm (Use Argon2 for password hashing \(add argon2-cffi and put it first in PASSWORD_HASHERS\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 709.39 Tm (Enforce password validators.) Tj ET
0.040 0.350 0.550 rg 61.00 697.39 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 694.89 Tm (Enforce permissions at the object level, not just the view level. A user must not be able to read or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 680.39 Tm (edit another user's records by changing an ID.) Tj ET
0.040 0.350 0.550 rg 61.00 668.39 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 665.89 Tm (The ORM protects against SQL injection only if you avoid raw string formatting in raw\(\) and extra\(\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 651.39 Tm (Template autoescaping protects against XSS only if you do not mark untrusted data as safe.) Tj ET
0.040 0.350 0.550 rg 61.00 639.39 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 636.89 Tm (Add a Content Security Policy, set X-Content-Type-Options, and keep dependencies patched) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 622.39 Tm (\(pip-audit, Dependabot\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 0.850 0.340 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 56.00 597.89 Tm (A6. Background tasks and caching) Tj ET
0.040 0.350 0.550 rg 61.00 582.89 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 580.39 Tm (Move slow or external work \(emails, payments, image processing, third-party calls\) out of the request) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 565.89 Tm (cycle into Celery workers with Redis or RabbitMQ as the broker.) Tj ET
0.040 0.350 0.550 rg 61.00 553.89 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 551.39 Tm (Make tasks idempotent and safe to retry. Configure retries with backoff. Never assume a task runs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 536.89 Tm (exactly once.) Tj ET
0.040 0.350 0.550 rg 61.00 524.89 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 522.39 Tm (Use Celery Beat for scheduled jobs. Monitor the queue depth and worker health.) Tj ET
0.040 0.350 0.550 rg 61.00 510.39 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 507.89 Tm (Cache expensive reads in Redis. Cache at the right layer: per-view caching, low-level cache.get/set) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.120 0.120 0.120 rg 1 0 0 1 70.00 493.39 Tm (for computed values, or template fragment caching.) Tj ET
